# Authors

John Valdez is the author of the KateM5Rust Rust work. Copyright 2026.

KateM5Rust is derived from study of KDE Kate, KTextEditor, and
KSyntaxHighlighting. The KDE contributors wrote those works.

The pinned upstream trees do not contain an AUTHORS file. The KDE
contributors are named in the SPDX-FileCopyrightText lines of those trees
and in the upstream commit history:

- https://invent.kde.org/utilities/kate
- https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/ktexteditor
- https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/syntax-highlighting
